usage: s1b.py [-h]
              {validate-splits,snapshot-build,snapshot-verify,snapshot-activate,run,resume,replay} ...

审核划分、知识快照与实验断点恢复

positional arguments:
  {validate-splits,snapshot-build,snapshot-verify,snapshot-activate,run,resume,replay}
    validate-splits     离线检查人工审核清单的组隔离
    snapshot-build      从审核文档和已有向量构建离线快照
    snapshot-verify     校验快照
    snapshot-activate   原子激活本地完整快照
    run                 显式执行或恢复批处理；会调用所选模型
    resume              显式执行或恢复批处理；会调用所选模型
    replay              只读重算日志报告，不调用模型

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
